  "_readme": [
    "Connectors CI does not certify against a live sandbox.",
    "",
    "Two lists, deliberately separate. Read the one you are about to edit.",
    "",
    "grandfathered — connectors that predate certification and have never been",
    "proven. TODO: drive this list to zero. It can only shrink; CI fails if a",
    "name is added to it. A connector leaves it by gaining credentials in the",
    "CI credentials file, at which point CI requires the removal.",
    "",
    "unproven_new — a connector integrated after certification existed, merging",
    "without live proof. Each entry states why. This is an exception a",
    "maintainer accepted, not the default: being one of 101 names in the list",
    "above is a backlog, not a precedent."
  ],
